==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.
**20 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**7 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring at least 3 meatshields, Area Attackers & Zombie Killers like [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Sifu Cat]] to win the stage.

